# Force LF line endings on all platforms so shell scripts and CI
# workflows check out identically on Windows runners.
# A CRLF-checked-out script breaks quoted heredocs (the `EOF` delimiter
# becomes `EOF\r` and never terminates), so makensis never runs and the
# NSIS installer is never produced.
*.sh text eol=lf
*.yml text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf
